                                "sense_id": "deb23f78-aa78-315e-8b8f-e99cbcad9c33",
                                "text": "Laughter may be generally classed under three heads,—forced, silly, or vulgar; but hers is the most sweet, real, spirituelle sound possible..."
                            },
