                                "example_id": "3629977e-9fb3-4db7-88d1-806521145795",
                                "sense_id": "deb23f78-aa78-315e-8b8f-e99cbcad9c33",
                                "text": "Noble in person and in dress and of an unconscious majesty of demeanor, the beauty of the daughter of Marguerite de Valois was far beyond that of the conventional, artful beauties of her day; hers was a spirituelle, eloquent sweetness, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "337e4b79-e798-4c21-9dca-c7a732842fef",
                                "sense_id": "deb23f78-aa78-315e-8b8f-e99cbcad9c33",
                                "text": "[…] he was a little above medium height, well built and with a brisk step; his hair was black, his complexion deep brown, his physiognomy very spirituelle, his features regular."
                            }
                        ]
